'''Loving Labour''' (勤労感謝スペシャル！, ''Kinrō Kansha Supesharu!'', '''Labor Day Special!''') is the November event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Loving Labour'''}} returns to The Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} and see if you're tough enough to survive the worst workplace in the Cat Empire! But be careful, {{Color|#FF0000|'''Chief Peng'''}} just saw the quarterly projections and is looking to downsize anyone who can't pull their weight!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available November 1st (11:00am) thru December 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

You can collect {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Salaryman Cat'''}} upon clearing the event stages. Your chances will increase greatly if you play the difficult stages! (You have a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} chance to collect the reward when using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)

※ After you have picked up Salaryman Cat, you can find it under Rare Cats in the Upgrade screen. If you have collected Salaryman Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

